@title: Same-origin frames are entered
# expect-output: email=[ada@example.com]
# An iframe with a form, and a nested iframe below the fold. Every step
# below is addressed to the element's own frame.
STEP 1: The host page itself
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/frames.html
    CLICK the 'Host button' button
    VERIFY that 'host clicked' is present
STEP 2: A form inside an iframe
    FILL 'Email' field with 'ada@example.com'
    CHECK the checkbox for 'Subscribe to news'
    SELECT 'Pro' from the 'Plan' dropdown
    VERIFY 'Email' field has value 'ada@example.com'
    VERIFY that 'Subscribe to news' is checked
    CLICK the 'Save form' button
    VERIFY that 'Saved ada@example.com news=true plan=Pro' is present
    EXTRACT the 'Email' into {e}
    PRINT "email=[{e}]"
STEP 3: A nested iframe below the fold
    CLICK the 'Deep button' button
    VERIFY that 'inner clicked' is present
    HOVER over the 'Deep button'
    WAIT FOR 'Deep button' to be visible
DONE.
